{"policyVersion":3,"items":[{"translations":{"en":["My Hero Academia: Make It! Do-or-Die Survival Training","In this brand-new adventure, some Class 1-A students are sent to hone their survival skills at a training course. Having yet to receive their provisional licenses, they're eager to cut loose and have a little fun. They quickly discover that the danger they face is no simulation! It's going to take their combined training, teamwork, and quick thinking if they're going to pass this assignment!\n\n\n\n(Source: Funimation)"],"ja":["僕のヒーローアカデミア 生き残れ！決死のサバイバル訓練",""]},"airedAt":null,"relations":[],"id":"mal-42603","ids":{"shikimori":42603,"mal":42603,"anilist":122349,"kodik":"serial-33288"},"kodikIds":["serial-28708","serial-29278","serial-33288"],"kodikRevisions":{"serial-28708":"2020-09-13T18:27:49Z","serial-29278":"2020-09-15T06:23:24Z","serial-33288":"2021-03-17T19:53:27Z"},"title":"Моя геройская академия: Сделай это! Тренировка на выживание","originalTitle":"Boku no Hero Academia: Ikinokore! Kesshi no Survival Kunren","alt":"My Hero Academia: Make It! Do-or-Die Survival Training My Hero Academia: Make It! Do-or-Die Survival Training 僕のヒーローアカデミア 生き残れ！決死のサバイバル訓練","description":"Студенты класса 1-А отправляются оттачивать навыки на тренировке по выживанию. Однако они быстро обнаруживают, что опасность, с которой они столкнулись, вполне серьёзна! Им потребуются вся их подготовка, умение работать в команде и быстро принимать решения, если они хотят успешно завершить это задание.","year":2020,"type":"ONA","genres":["Сёнен","Экшен","Школа","супер сила"],"rating":7.17,"popularity":56139,"ongoing":false,"relatedMalIds":[],"artwork":{"poster":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/uploads/poster/animes/42603/095b22f2f40f2ae390753651c8fa93b6.jpeg","width":423,"height":600},"backdrop":{"url":"https://shikimori.io/system/screenshots/original/1264b15e1eb7180807873285792a89b2b0e1d20f.jpg","width":1280,"height":720}},"releasedEpisodes":[1,2],"episodes":[{"number":1,"ordinal":1,"season":